+The standalone CI configuration targets **GitLab Pages**. To integrate with an existing Wiki, keep its pipeline and append [the integration commands](ci/wiki-integration.yml) after the Wiki build. A future GitHub repository can host this source; a GitHub Actions workflow is not included.
